          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A rectangle 5 m by 24 m is cut along a straight line from a corner to an opposite side to make a right-angled triangle and a trapezium.\n\nThe two shapes are then rearranged to form a large right-angled triangle.\n\nDetermine two possible perimeters of the large right-angled triangle. Round any non-integer answer to 2 decimal places.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p38-q13-hint",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "fontSize": null,
